          "section_title": "SECTION 2 - ELIGIBILITY",
          "ref": "2.1",
          "page": 1,
          "text": "2.1 Eligible Risks. A risk is eligible if all of the following are true: (a) construction class is CC1 through CC6; (b) Public Protection Class is PC1 through PC8; (c) the building is not vacant and has not been vacant for more than 60 consecutive days in the prior 12 months; (d) Total Insured Value (TIV) does not exceed $25,000,000 per location; (e) the class code is not listed as Prohibited in Section 2.3.",
